NOTE ON DATA AND MODEL LICENCES

This MIT licence covers the *code* in this repository only.

The datasets (Cholec80, Endoscapes2023, CholecT50) and the surgical vision-language
models (SurgVLP / HecVL / PeskaVLP) are released by their authors under
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0: non-commercial research use, attribution, share-alike. MedSigLIP is
subject to the Health AI Developer Foundations terms.

No video frames, videos, annotations or per-frame embeddings are distributed here.
This repository contains only the scripts that regenerate them from the official
sources, which you must download yourself after accepting the relevant licences.
See docs/datasets.md.
